Third-party components
----------------------

The released checkpoints contain an image trunk initialised from
torchvision's ImageNet-pretrained ResNet (resnet50, IMAGENET1K_V2 weights;
the resnet18 variant uses IMAGENET1K_V1). The stages up to and including
layer2 are frozen during training and embed the pretrained parameters
(bit-exact in the best_model.pth that qa_train.py writes locally; equal
up to weight-EMA floating-point rounding, at most 6e-3 absolute, in the
released best_ema_calibrated.pth files); later stages are fine-tuned
and are derived from, but not copies of, the torchvision parameters.
Every other tensor is trained from random initialisation by the code in
this folder. torchvision is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license:
