Dataset material
----------------

COCO configuration: the demo label files under samples/ derive from the
COCO 2017 annotations, which are distributed by the COCO Consortium under
CC BY 4.0. The demo photographs are NOT redistributed -- they are fetched
from COCO's image server by samples/fetch_samples.py, with per-image
Flickr sources and licenses listed in samples/ATTRIBUTION.md. Training
data (COCO images and annotation files) is obtained by the user from
cocodataset.org and remains subject to its own terms.

VOC configuration: no Pascal VOC 2012 images or annotations are
redistributed. The dataset is downloaded by the user at run time
(download_pascal_voc_2012_dataset.py) and remains subject to its own
terms.
